00:48:26.590 --> 00:48:30.928
[MARIACHI MUSIC]

00:48:38.624 --> 00:48:40.290
PRESENTER: The start
of the new semester

00:48:40.290 --> 00:48:42.780
also saw the observance
of another MIT

00:48:42.780 --> 00:48:44.670
tradition, the hack.

00:48:44.670 --> 00:48:47.475
Regular viewers of ZigZag will
remember our coverage of a hack

00:48:47.475 --> 00:48:50.580
last semester, in which the
Cal Tech cannon appeared

00:48:50.580 --> 00:48:53.010
mysteriously on MIT'S campus.

00:48:53.010 --> 00:48:55.890
This term, the fifth
anniversary of September 11,

00:48:55.890 --> 00:48:58.770
was commemorated by the
equally mysterious appearance

00:48:58.770 --> 00:49:03.210
of a full-sized fire truck
perched atop MIT'S Great Dome.

00:49:03.210 --> 00:49:05.497
CHANDAWARKAR: I saw the
fire engine on the Dome

00:49:05.497 --> 00:49:07.580
when I was walking over
