04:39:04.890 --> 04:39:07.869
be presented to students
in the School of Science

04:39:07.869 --> 04:39:11.910
who have completed the
specified degree requirements.

04:39:11.910 --> 04:39:14.340
Master of Science in Physics.

04:39:14.340 --> 04:39:16.779
[READING NAMES]

04:39:18.246 --> 04:39:20.880
Master of Science in
Atmospheric Science.

04:39:20.880 --> 04:39:23.040
[READING NAMES]

04:39:25.320 --> 04:39:27.150
Master of Science
in Mathematics.

04:39:27.150 --> 04:39:29.009
[READING NAMES]

04:39:31.905 --> 04:39:34.740
Doctor of Philosophy with
all the rights and privileges

04:39:34.740 --> 04:39:36.689
pertaining thereto.

04:39:36.689 --> 04:39:39.260
[READING NAMES]

04:44:51.655 --> 04:44:54.550
The Woods Hole
Oceanographic Institution

04:44:54.550 --> 04:44:57.580
and the Massachusetts
Institute of Technology

04:44:57.580 --> 04:45:01.060
offer joint programs of
education and research

04:45:01.060 --> 04:45:05.200
in oceanography and applied
ocean science and engineering.

04:45:05.200 --> 04:45:09.220
Dr. James A. Yoder, vice
president for academic programs

04:45:09.220 --> 04:45:12.580
and Dean at the Woods Hole
Oceanographic Institution,

04:45:12.580 --> 04:45:15.100
is here to participate
with President Hockfield

04:45:15.100 --> 04:45:18.130
in awarding the
following joint degrees.

04:45:18.130 --> 04:45:21.300
Master of Science in
Oceanographic Engineering.

04:45:21.300 --> 04:45:23.530
[READING NAMES]

04:45:29.695 --> 04:45:33.280
Master of Science in Marine
Geology and Geophysics.

04:45:33.280 --> 04:45:34.930
[READING NAMES]

04:45:38.170 --> 04:45:40.960
Doctor of Philosophy with
all the rights and privileges

04:45:40.960 --> 04:45:42.550
pertaining thereto.

04:45:42.550 --> 04:45:44.725
[READING NAMES]

04:46:05.155 --> 04:46:07.360
Advanced degree
diplomas will now

04:46:07.360 --> 04:46:10.450
be presented to students in
the Whittaker College of Health

04:46:10.450 --> 04:46:14.320
Sciences and Technology who have
completed the specified degree

04:46:14.320 --> 04:46:15.970
requirements.

04:46:15.970 --> 04:46:19.090
Master of Science in
Biomedical Informatics.

04:46:19.090 --> 04:46:20.910
[READING NAMES]

04:46:23.605 --> 04:46:26.650
Master of Science in Health
Sciences and Technology.

04:46:26.650 --> 04:46:28.590
[READING NAMES]

04:46:31.050 --> 04:46:33.730
Doctor of Philosophy with
all the rights and privileges

04:46:33.730 --> 04:46:35.470
pertaining thereto.

04:46:35.470 --> 04:46:37.665
[READING NAMES]

04:55:45.417 --> 04:55:47.840
Master of Science in Management.

04:55:47.840 --> 04:55:49.806
[READING NAMES]

04:55:57.000 --> 04:56:00.150
Master of Science in
